 Working notes for Train Robber that change faster than the code. The requirements and technical design stay in the repo under [`docs/`](https://github.com/devlinjunker/train-robber/tree/main/docs).
 
+- [Roadmap](Roadmap): what's coming in the rest of Phase 2, Phase 3 and the generated-maps (G) series.
 - [Ideas](Ideas): every idea not yet scheduled in a phase, including ones raised in playtests.
 - [Playtesting](Playtesting): how to play a build, switch variants, tune values and record what you found.
 - [Creating maps](Creating-maps): how to make a new map in Tiled and play it with `?map=`.
